section: Prerequisites;;

subtext: rust is not a simple:;bold:;italy' language, although it is totally
possible to start with rust as your first language, it is only
wise if you are someone who is willing to push 6months-1year
seeing no results, otherwise it is recommended to have experience
with at least 1 other intermediate to difficult type safe language.
rust devs do not just program with rust so we will discuss other
languages as well, if you go raw into rust you will likely give up;;

